==Battleground==
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s (200%) spawn, delay 23.33~29.33 seconds<sup>700f~880f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] (200%) spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] (400%) spawns.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] (200%) spawns.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy stage, using meatshields and long-ranged cats like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. Tanky cats with lots of health will help too, like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. If you have them, strong, spammable [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Figure Skating Cats]] can also help. [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red]] cats like [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] can be used to counter the St. Pigge the 2nds.

