==Trivia==
*Sword of Achilles is a pun that was lost in translation. In Japanese, it's アキレスの剣 Akiresu no Ken ("Sword of Achilles"), which sounds much like アキレス腱 ''Akiresu-ken'' ("[[wikipedia:Achilles' heel|Achilles heel]]" or "[[wikipedia:Achilles tendon|Achilles tendon]]").

